  - tools/call        -> run a MindMex tool (generate episode, gen video, TTS, export)
  - resources/notifications (log-ready, optional)

The tools wrap the MindMex pipeline + the media/TTS provider registries, so an
agent can "log in and use" Real production tools.

Run (stdio, for an MCP client):
    python3 mcp_server.py
Connect in Claude Code / .mcp.json:
    {"mcpServers": {"mindmex": {"command": "python3", "args": ["/home/nova/Downloads/MindMex/mcp_server.py"]}}}

Tools exposed:
  list_series            -> list existing series bibles
  generate_episode       -> plan + generate a full episode (scenes, scripts, prompts)
  gen_video_scene        -> generate a video clip for a scene via Runway/Luma/Pika/HeyGen
  tts                    -> synthesize narration via ElevenLabs or local OSS TTS
